<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from June 26 to July 2 the 1997:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 70.00</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 74.55</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 76.65</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 80.50</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$189.61</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$142.21</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$101.09</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 27.30</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.73</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 30.10</p>
</text>
